'''Baboon Thralls''' are a monster encountered in the Path of Apmeken within the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They are summoned by [[Baboon Shaman]]s.

They share a similar prayer drain mechanic as the shamans, draining some prayer based on a percentage of what the hit dealt, including successful hits that would otherwise be blocked by prayer.

